  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups flour",
    "2 cups granulated sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "2 teaspoons McCormick® Cinnamon, Ground",
    "0.5 teaspoon McCormick® Nutmeg, Ground",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1.25 cups vegetable oil",
    "4 eggs, lightly beaten",
    "1 tablespoon McCormick® Pure Vanilla Extract",
    "3 cups finely grated carrots",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "0.5 teaspoon McCormick® Pure Lemon Extract",
    "1 (16 ounce) box confectioners' sugar",
    "1 tablespoon milk, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (180 degrees C). Line 24 muffin cups with liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rOPSIePivjOlGE3B4TY-to0XNT4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246585-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-lemon-cream-cheese-frosting-VAT-step-01-075304af06a548ce95715525560d4801.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246585/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the carrot cake cupcakes: Stir flour, sugar, baking powder, cinnamon, nutmeg, and salt together in a large bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZC0iknBZ9gO8pYf4x2o09odjOww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246585-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-lemon-cream-cheese-frosting-VAT-step-02-2669d05f6bda49e093cfd815c7db8464.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246585/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add oil, eggs, and vanilla; mix well. Add carrots; mix until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fyxI3_0UaW2Hh7V9f_WNayx19I0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246585-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-lemon-cream-cheese-frosting-VAT-step-03-2a77489b56df4c20978dbb1df3f6253e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246585/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into the prepared muffin cups, filling each 2/3 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VIjBpnxrk5B7lpxSq-HSeY440fo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246585-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-lemon-cream-cheese-frosting-VAT-step-04-6fc9f6c746f84f9c88d57eab7502f92d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246585/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into a cupcake comes out clean, about 20 minutes. Cool cupcakes briefly in the pans on a wire rack. Remove cupcakes from the pans; cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8pdRkF8EZwrRa2UNC4q2itbdmtA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246585-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-lemon-cream-cheese-frosting-VAT-step-05-0385e90ff4d24802a036f42c69a0cb7a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246585/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the lemon frosting: Beat cream cheese, butter, and lemon extract together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O-WWoBOsJtoxcEm9k6ntRALUgr4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246585-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-lemon-cream-cheese-frosting-VAT-step-06-088d8cdd8cdf4188964c13b2fe34c859.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246585/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually beat in confectioners’ sugar until smooth. If frosting is too thick to spread, gradually beat in milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/--2-4oFjK8KK72kxYOVYFo6-d50=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246585-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-lemon-cream-cheese-frosting-VAT-step-07-e980e349c2c84d7092bed731ab4b2f8c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246585/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Frost cooled cupcakes with frosting.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fR30k2fY1H8eFzEuvZBzaLae2ck=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-246585-carrot-cake-cupcakes-with-lemon-cream-cheese-frosting-VAT-step-08-c718dac6bf50482c801bde7d06feb3fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/246585/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
